From 3be2bd6fdb544b592cdbfa3703c6c263c3291042 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 10:05:35 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18c: route password save and update offers to
 the host

Transfer ChromePasswordManagerClient browser-less save/update offers into a per-WebContents adapter owning Chromium PasswordFormManagerForUI. Expose origin and username only; host save/never/dismiss invokes Chromium store and blocklist methods. Cancel pending offers on subsequent navigation, close and callback replacement. ABI 1.22 / bridge 0.24.0; build p62, native password save/update/dismiss/never/cancellation, and Login Data postchecks pass. Full regression and replay evidence is in WAVE-18C-REPORT.md.

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
